<title>UK: Nationwide launches credit card.</title>
<headline>Nationwide launches credit card.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Nationwide Building Society said on Tuesday it would launch its own credit and gold cards which will be available in March.</p>
<p>Nationwide, one of Britain's biggest building societies, claimed that the cards would offer virtually the lowest interest rates available and said there would be no annual fee.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the new credit cards were initially being piloted by its employees. The cards will be then be made available to new and exisiting customers from March.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
